    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Conveniently located close to the centre of Clonakilty town in this quiet well kept estate, only 7/8 minutes walk, on the flat, to all of Clonakilty`s town amenities.\nThis riverside setting is so pleasant adjacent to the lovely Bennetts Mill field park`. \nThe property is in walk in condition, complemented by an enclosed low maintenance rear yard, that has a side access. \nExtending to c. 925 SqFt with an entrance hall, open plan, living/kitchen/dining area, downstairs toilet, 3 bedrooms and a bathroom. \nThis property would ideally suit those looking to trade down to an easily managed property or a first time buyer looking for a good investment close to the town centre. \n\nAccommodation c. 86 m²/ 925 ft² \n\nEntrance Hall 2.1 m x 2.5 m\nBright entrance hall with glazed door, carpeted floor & fitted storage closet.\nDownstairs toilet.\n\nKitchen / Living / Dining Room 3.3 m x 7.6 m / 5.6 m x 3.5 m\nBright room, open plan, timber floor to living area, open fire, & glazed sliding doors to rear patio.\nKitchen with tiled floor, fitted kitchen units, white goods included, cooker, fridge freezer, washing machine.\n\nDownstairs toilet 1.2 m x 1.5 m\nWC, wash hand basin.\n\nCarpeted stairs to first floor landing\nAiring closet.\n \nBathroom 2.6 m x 1.7 m\nBath, WC, wash hand basin and electric shower.\n\nBedroom One 2.9 m x 2.9 m\nDouble bedroom with fitted wardrobe. \n\nBedroom Two (Main) 2.9 m x 4.56 m \nDouble bedroom with attractive view west onto the river. Carpeted, fitted wardrobe and press.\n\nBedroom Three 2.6 m x 3.17 m\nSingle bedroom with view onto the river. Fitted wardrobe, carpeted.\n\nPatio approx. 6 m x 6 m\nSlabbed patio area ideal for catching the evening sun.\n\nServices\nThe property is connected to all main services including water, sewerage, electricity & telephone services. Heating is via electric storage heaters & there is an open fire in the sitting room. Windows & doors are timber double glazed.\n\nFurther information\nThe property can be found close to the centre of Clonakilty in a well located estate that was constructed c. 1994. There is off street car parking to the front. There is a raised patio area to the front of the house. We understand the property is of concrete block construction. \nFolio CK169782F."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
